ple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1049","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[23,22,73,69,85,55],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008602","armor":"WP1014502","helmet":"WP1012602"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1049","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[23,22,73,69,85,55],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008602","armor":"WP1014502","helmet":"WP1012602"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1049","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[23,22,73,69,85,55],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008602","armor":"WP1014502","helmet":"WP1012602"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1011","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[23,22,73,69,85,55],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008602","armor":"WP1014502","helmet":"WP1012602"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10582","city":"CS1049","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[23,22,73,69,85,55],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008602","armor":"WP1014502","helmet":"WP1012602"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"桂阳太守赵范的嫂子。有国色，曾提出改嫁的三个条件：一要文武双全，名闻天下；二要相貌堂堂，威仪出众；三要与前夫同姓（赵姓）。赵云进攻桂阳期间，赵范投降，并试图巴结赵云，欲将其寡嫂樊氏嫁给赵云，但被赵云怒斥拒绝，因此使其与赵云结怨。","tc":"桂陽太守趙范的嫂子。有國色，曾提出改嫁的三個條件：一要文武雙全，名聞天下；二要相貌堂堂，威儀出眾；三要與前夫同姓（趙姓）。趙云進攻桂陽期間，趙范投降，并試圖巴結趙云，欲將其寡嫂樊氏嫁給趙云，但被趙云怒斥拒絕，因此使其與趙云結怨。","en":"The sister-in-law of Zhao Fan, Governor of Guiyang. Possessing exceptional beauty, she had once set three conditions for remarrying: first, her suitor must be accomplished in both civil and military arts and renowned throughout the realm, second, he must be dignified in appearance and imposing in bearing, third, he must share the surname of her late husband (Zhao). During Zhao Yun's campaign against Guiyang, Zhao Fan surrendered and, trying to ingratiate himself, offered his widowed sister-in-law Lady Fan in marriage to Zhao Yun. Zhao Yun angrily rebuked and refused him, which created lasting animosity between them.","jp":"桂陽太守・趙範の義姉。傾国の美貌の持ち主で、かつて再婚にあたり三つの条件を挙げていた。一に文武を兼ね備え天下に名を知られていること、二に堂々たる容貌で威儀に優れていること、三に亡夫と同姓（趙姓）であること。趙雲が桂陽へ侵攻した際、趙範は降伏し、趙雲に取り入ろうと未亡人である義姉の樊氏を嫁がせようとしたが、趙雲に一喝され拒絶されたため、趙雲と確執を生むこととなった。","kr":"계양태수 조범의 형수. 경국지색의 미모를 지녔으며, 일찍이 재가의 조건으로 세 가지를 내걸었다. 첫째는 문무를 겸비하여 천하에 명성을 떨칠 것, 둘째는 풍채가 당당하고 위의가 출중할 것, 셋째는 전남편과 같은 조(趙)씨 성일 것이었다. 조운이 계양을 공격할 당시 조범은 항복한 후 조운의 환심을 사고자 과부가 된 형수 번씨를 조운에게 시집보내려 했으나, 조운이 크게 꾸짖으며 거절하여 이 일로 조운과 원한을 맺게 되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10620","remark":"","surname":"樊","surnameTc":"樊","surnameEn":"Fan","surnameJp":"樊","surnameKr":"번","surnameOther":"","name":"氏","nameTc":"氏","nameEn":"Shi","nameJp":"氏","nameKr":"씨","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"樊氏","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"200","city":"CS1011","gender":"1","rule":"23","force":"22","wise":"73","politics":"69","charm":"85","will":"55","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"4","weaponMaster":"6/6/6/6/6/32/72/6","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1